e + N2(v=0) -> e + N2(v=4) resonant vibrational excitation. Rate: Laporta et al., Plasma Sources Sci. Technol. 23, 065002 (2014), Eq. (10) fit, supplementary v_i = 0 -> v_f = 4 (T_max, kappa_max), evaluated at T_e = (2/3) x table energy (mean electron energy). Header = eps_vf (Laporta Table II). v = 0 only, no superelastic return, resonant only (see scripts/build_n2_vibrational_tables.py). Reaction set abep-n2n-0.7.
